  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "bsrn-nsrdb-aggregated",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tBSRN NSRDB PSM v4 aggregated\n\t\n\nPoint-extracted NSRDB (National Solar Radiation Database) PSM v4 (aggregated variant) data for Baseline Surface Radiation Network (BSRN) stations.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\nEach file contains 30-minute NSRDB variables at a single BSRN station location. Extraction is performed via the NREL NSRDB API (NLR). The aggregated variant (v4.0.0) provides 4 km spatial resolution and covers the Contiguous United States and other regions using the GOES archive\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dazhiyang/bsrn-nsrdb-aggregated.",
  "alternateName": [
    "dazhiyang/bsrn-nsrdb-aggregated",
    "BSRN NSRDB PSM v4 aggregated"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Dazhi Yang",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/dazhiyang"
  },
